# --- Opening Briefing & Act 1 Dialogue ---
when at 0:00 do say "[HQ]: Like Hall said, your first objective is to assault and destroy the two Order bases located to your north. HQ out." voice X01_HQ_M01_02881; camera CDRWarp zoom 85
when at 0:10 do say "[Fletcher]: You just gated into a hell of a mess, Colonel, but I'm glad you're here." voice X01_Fletcher_M01_03419
when at 0:20 do say "[HQ]: We're uploading the Percival schematic to your ACU; it's a siege assault bot modified to cross water. HQ out." voice X01_HQ_M01_04230
when at 0:32 do say "[HQ]: There's a line of enemy artillery protecting the bases, plus subs in the channel. Clear them out if you can." voice X01_HQ_M01_04847
when at 0:45 do say "[Gari]: On this day, the Coalition will fall. No one will escape our wrath." voice X01_Gari_M01_04005

